# ECCN Security and Operations

Review these known risks:

- Default `admin/admin` and Mongo `root/secret` are committed local defaults.
- Actuator exposes all endpoints and health details.
- No explicit `SecurityFilterChain` was found.
- Docker builds with `-DskipTests` and full JDK image.
- CORS omits PATCH while Product API uses PATCH.
- Postman auth flow implies Keycloak/OIDC but local deployment does not provide it.
